# Python venv for the media pipeline (imageio-ffmpeg, python-pptx, python-docx).
# Debian blocks `pip install --user` under PEP 668, so the recording and deck scripts
# run on .venv/bin/python. Created with --system-site-packages so the system-installed
# `websocket` and `PIL` stay visible. Recreate with `npm run media:setup`.
.venv/

